WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.417 --> 00:00:02.419
Marjan: 
We’re going into the belly of
the beast. 

00:00:02.419 --> 00:00:03.420
Can you handle it?

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:04.254
♪♪

00:00:04.254 --> 00:00:04.922
I'll see it through.

00:00:04.922 --> 00:00:06.882
♪♪

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:09.426
♪♪ 

00:00:09.426 --> 00:00:11.595
Tamar:
The Mossad sent me to Tehran on
a mission.

00:00:11.595 --> 00:00:12.596
(Sirens and tires squealing)

00:00:12.596 --> 00:00:14.431
Tamar:
But then everything went
wrong.

00:00:14.431 --> 00:00:15.641
(Detonator clicking and car
exploding)

00:00:15.641 --> 00:00:16.850
♪♪

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:17.893
Tamar:
We have to go. Now.

00:00:17.893 --> 00:00:19.978
♪♪

00:00:19.978 --> 00:00:21.313
Tamar:
Half the guard is looking
for us.

00:00:21.313 --> 00:00:22.439
♪♪

00:00:22.439 --> 00:00:23.440
We can't get out.

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:24.441
(Guns firing)

00:00:24.441 --> 00:00:26.443
♪♪

00:00:26.443 --> 00:00:27.986
Marjan:
You're a good agent, Tamar.

00:00:28.445 --> 00:00:31.865
Marjan:
We failed this operation, but it
wasn't for nothing.

00:00:31.865 --> 00:00:32.866
♪♪

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:34.368
Marjan:
We're playing a long game here.

00:00:34.785 --> 00:00:35.786
Tamar:
Who sent you?

00:00:35.786 --> 00:00:36.912
♪♪

00:00:36.912 --> 00:00:37.913
Trust me.

00:00:37.913 --> 00:00:41.708
♪♪

00:00:44.586 --> 00:00:45.963
This operation is highly
classified.

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:48.090
Yulia:
We need to stop him cold.

00:00:48.090 --> 00:00:49.883
♪♪

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:51.468
You went back to work for them?

00:00:51.468 --> 00:00:52.552
Tamar:
I had no choice.

00:00:53.095 --> 00:00:54.096
Marjan:
If you pull this off,

00:00:54.596 --> 00:00:55.764
Marjan:
we'll help you escape.

00:00:56.223 --> 00:00:57.307
Marjan:
Can you handle it?

00:00:57.307 --> 00:00:58.475
♪♪

00:00:58.475 --> 00:00:59.476
I'll see it through.

00:00:59.977 --> 00:01:00.978
I know you will.

00:01:00.978 --> 00:01:04.106
♪♪

00:01:04.106 --> 00:01:05.524
Yulia:
It will be maximum security,

00:01:06.108 --> 00:01:07.734
Yulia:
dozens of Sepah agents.

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:08.860
♪♪

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:09.861
Be careful.

00:01:09.861 --> 00:01:12.489
Yulia:
Faraz knows Tamar better than
anyone in Iran.

00:01:12.489 --> 00:01:14.157
Yulia:
I trust you to take care of
them.

00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:16.493
♪♪

00:01:16.493 --> 00:01:18.495
Marjan:
We're are going into the belly
of the beast.

00:01:18.495 --> 00:01:19.496
♪♪

00:01:19.496 --> 00:01:21.039
Milad's not train for this.

00:01:21.039 --> 00:01:21.540
He can do it.

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:23.917
Amir:
We have trouble.

00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:26.086
♪♪

00:01:26.086 --> 00:01:27.421
There's been a change of plans!

00:01:27.421 --> 00:01:28.171
♪♪

00:01:28.171 --> 00:01:29.172
Milad:
I'm getting us out!

00:01:29.506 --> 00:01:30.841
Tamar:
There's no getting out!

00:01:30.841 --> 00:01:33.260
♪♪

00:01:33.260 --> 00:01:35.804
If we screw this up, I might not
be able to protect you.

00:01:35.804 --> 00:01:39.641
♪♪

00:01:39.641 --> 00:01:42.769
This plan could fail, and expose
our entire network.

00:01:42.769 --> 00:01:45.731
♪♪

00:01:45.731 --> 00:01:46.982
Marjan:
Everything depends on it.

00:01:46.982 --> 00:01:47.983
♪♪

00:01:47.983 --> 00:01:49.318
Tamar:
Do you realize what you've done?

00:01:49.318 --> 00:01:50.485
I'm saving us!

00:01:50.485 --> 00:01:52.279
♪♪

00:01:52.279 --> 00:01:53.780
Yulia:
It's putting us all at risk.

00:01:54.364 --> 00:01:56.616
This operation is not to be
compromised.

00:01:56.616 --> 00:02:01.121
♪♪

00:02:01.121 --> 00:02:02.831
You might not get out of there
alive.

00:02:02.831 --> 00:02:05.625
♪♪

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:06.918
Tamar:
I have to make it right.

00:02:06.918 --> 00:02:08.003
♪♪

